        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mid terrace two bedroom house.\r\nBenefitting from a yard to the rear.\r\nExcellent location off Baggot Street Upper offering an array of shops, bars and restaurants. \r\nWithin walking distance to Lansdowne Dart Station.\r\nConvenient to Dublin City Centre, Grand Canal Dock and Ballsbridge. \r\nExtending to approximately 82 sq. m (883 sq. ft). \r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a mid terraced two bedroom house with a garden to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately xx sq. m (xx sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
